BlinkMimic / InstantTrack / supermimic_vibed
=========================================

BlinkMimic (Fuyi Chen, 2026), reference commit
d264658d6c9ce61fb52f9f0f8985a369f3ccc409:
https://github.com/fuyichen0725/blinkmimic

rl/optim.py adapts the upstream optimizer implementation. Structured dynamics,
loss scales, reference residuals, EMA, mirrored replay, failure-directed resets,
policy probes and contact shaping adapt designs in networks.py, mirror.py,
train.py, env.py, mdp.py and motion.py. The shared method remains SuperMimic
(Liao et al., 2026): https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.28480. BlinkMimic builds upon
https://github.com/Huy-Quang-Dao/instantTrack and
https://github.com/zita-ch/supermimic_vibed. Muon: Jordan et al. (2024),
https://github.com/KellerJordan/Muon; the implementation calls PyTorch's optimizer.
Existing CuboiLeo attribution above remains applicable. Data licenses are separate.

